WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:03.120
Kia ora and welcome to the Invercargill
Public Library

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:04.700
In celebration of Māori Language Week

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:06.940
we encourage you to learn this phrase with us.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.560
Kei hea te wāhi whakahoki pukapuka?

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.160
Which translates to "where do I return my
books?"

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.040
did you catch what the word for books was?

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:17.920
It's pukapuka.

